WEBVTT

00:00:05.974 --> 00:00:07.034
When you watch Zettai Karen Children,
turn on the lights and sit back from the TV.
Remember, when you watch TV...

00:00:07.034 --> 00:00:09.304
When you watch Zettai Karen Children,
turn on the lights and sit back from the TV.
Turn on the lights and sit back from the TV!

00:00:09.304 --> 00:00:09.934
When you watch Zettai Karen Children,
turn on the lights and sit back from the TV.

00:00:16.384 --> 00:00:19.614
C-Colonel, taking that file
out of here is forbidden!

00:00:19.614 --> 00:00:23.654
Drop your weapons. You know
they're useless against me.

00:00:23.654 --> 00:00:24.584
Colonel!

00:00:29.124 --> 00:00:31.684
Colonel! Colonel Grisham!

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:42.994
Hello. Sorry to have called you here like this.

00:00:44.004 --> 00:00:46.574
You said it was an emergency, sir?

00:00:46.574 --> 00:00:49.304
Yes. Emergency and top secret, too.

00:00:50.044 --> 00:00:52.914
We've received a request from
the Comerican esper team

00:00:52.914 --> 00:00:54.654
for a joint mission with BABEL.

00:00:54.654 --> 00:00:58.054
A mission that may affect
our own national security.

00:00:58.124 --> 00:00:59.224
Sir?

00:00:59.224 --> 00:01:02.924
I'll let the Comericans in charge
explain the details to you.

00:01:03.564 --> 00:01:05.964
As the prime minister of Japan, I'm ordering this!

00:01:05.964 --> 00:01:08.794
The government special esper
support laboratory BABEL

00:01:08.794 --> 00:01:11.204
is to give this matter the highest priority!

00:01:11.204 --> 00:01:12.104
Yes, sir!

00:01:16.074 --> 00:01:18.574
I'm Moga-chan! Emergency call, activated!

00:01:18.574 --> 00:01:20.044
I'm Moga-chan!

00:01:20.044 --> 00:01:23.304
Yes, we just got it. Oh? You want
us both to report at once?

00:01:24.584 --> 00:01:26.584
What beauty!

00:01:26.584 --> 00:01:27.584
Your beauty is truly a psychic power of its own!

00:01:27.584 --> 00:01:29.254
Um, Doctor, please...
Your beauty is truly a psychic power of its own!

00:01:29.254 --> 00:01:31.884
Dr. Sakaki, report to control, at once!
I want to get to know you better.

00:01:31.884 --> 00:01:34.054
Report to control, at once!
How about we go to a nice restaurant I found?

00:01:34.054 --> 00:01:35.724
Don't call me in now!

00:01:35.724 --> 00:01:36.654
Saved...

00:01:39.024 --> 00:01:41.724
Calm down, it's a simple problem.

00:01:44.004 --> 00:01:46.204
Miss, I just got a stomach ache!

00:01:46.204 --> 00:01:48.174
I'll take her to the nurse!

00:01:49.804 --> 00:01:51.834
Gotta go to the toilet!

00:01:52.404 --> 00:01:55.314
It's pretty awesome, invincible power!

00:01:55.714 --> 00:01:58.584
Boy, does it feel great

00:01:58.944 --> 00:02:01.714
Absolutely lovely! So we never lose!

00:02:02.154 --> 00:02:05.314
Come on, let's head for tomorrow!

00:02:07.224 --> 00:02:08.354
Zettai Karen Children

00:02:08.354 --> 00:02:09.524
Zettai Karen Children
Yeah!

00:02:09.524 --> 00:02:10.824
Zettai Karen Children
Absolutely!

00:02:10.824 --> 00:02:12.464
Zettai Karen Children

00:02:12.464 --> 00:02:13.484
Zettai Karen Children
Daring!

00:02:13.664 --> 00:02:16.964
It just takes a touch for me to know

00:02:16.964 --> 00:02:19.954
The limiter on my heart

00:02:20.134 --> 00:02:22.834
Has been released, and then you see

00:02:23.244 --> 00:02:26.434
Yes! Change the world!

00:02:26.674 --> 00:02:29.544
Trying again and again through hot battle!

00:02:29.844 --> 00:02:33.154
Reaching through what's real

00:02:33.154 --> 00:02:36.384
Absolutely lovely! So we never lose!

00:02:36.384 --> 00:02:39.324
The thrills just can't be beat!

00:02:40.454 --> 00:02:46.934
Courage begins to light the
darkness of the world

00:02:46.934 --> 00:02:52.874
It overflows with the miracles you gave

00:02:53.304 --> 00:02:57.704
If you can take pride in a smile

00:02:57.704 --> 00:02:59.694
That suits no one else

00:02:59.914 --> 00:03:04.444
Then let's go beyond the future now

00:03:04.444 --> 00:03:08.544
We can try over the future world!

00:03:08.784 --> 00:03:09.154
Yeah!

00:03:09.884 --> 00:03:10.544
Ultimate!

00:03:12.694 --> 00:03:13.914
Daring!

00:03:23.704 --> 00:03:25.664
15th sense.
"The Golden Rule! Don't Run Away!!"

00:03:25.664 --> 00:03:26.904
15th sense.
"The Golden Rule! Don't Run Away!!"
Twenty-six hours ago,

00:03:26.904 --> 00:03:27.604
Twenty-six hours ago,

00:03:27.604 --> 00:03:31.504
a member of the Comerican Japan
esper team went AWOL.

00:03:32.074 --> 00:03:33.274
Deserted!

00:03:33.274 --> 00:03:36.344
Your mission is to assist
the Comerican esper team

00:03:36.344 --> 00:03:38.474
in apprehending the escaped esper!

00:03:39.214 --> 00:03:41.014
An esper deserter?!

00:03:41.014 --> 00:03:43.124
I doubt he'll surrender quietly.

00:03:43.124 --> 00:03:46.394
But, if it's a Comerican, then?

00:03:46.394 --> 00:03:49.624
Yeah, they should handle this themselves, right?

00:03:49.624 --> 00:03:52.734
Of course the Comericans are
acting as well. However...

00:03:52.734 --> 00:03:56.184
Why don't I fill you in on the rest?

00:03:56.704 --> 00:03:58.134
Ken! Mary!

00:04:00.174 --> 00:04:02.334
They're the ones from the hot spring resort!

00:04:02.334 --> 00:04:03.564
The Comerican espers!

00:04:12.754 --> 00:04:14.814
You already know each other.

00:04:14.814 --> 00:04:17.184
Lieutenants Ken McGuire and Mary Ford,

00:04:17.184 --> 00:04:20.084
the Comerican esper team
stationed here in Japan.

00:04:21.324 --> 00:04:22.514
Who?

00:04:25.924 --> 00:04:31.424
The deserter is Colonel J.D. Grisham,
our superior officer.

00:04:32.674 --> 00:04:35.034
The commander of your Japan esper team.

00:04:35.034 --> 00:04:38.404
There are three reasons we've
asked for BABEL's help.

00:04:38.404 --> 00:04:39.914
Number one!

00:04:39.914 --> 00:04:43.144
This has occurred within the territory of Japan.

00:04:43.144 --> 00:04:46.854
You Japanese know the details
of Japan better than we do.

00:04:46.854 --> 00:04:47.914
Two!

00:04:47.914 --> 00:04:52.384
As our commander, the colonel is
very familiar with our powers.

00:04:52.384 --> 00:04:56.264
If we work alone, odds are he'll
be able to get around us.

00:04:56.264 --> 00:05:00.034
Three! The colonel intends to defect.

00:05:00.034 --> 00:05:02.964
If he does, the information he has learned,

00:05:02.964 --> 00:05:06.334
like the secret information he has
on an allied country like Japan,

00:05:06.334 --> 00:05:08.604
may fall into the hands of another nation.

00:05:10.104 --> 00:05:14.134
Japan is not uninvolved! Do you understand?

00:05:14.274 --> 00:05:16.784
Now, I'll lay out your assignments!

00:05:16.784 --> 00:05:18.844
Wait a second, please!

00:05:18.844 --> 00:05:22.884
Are these the only members
for this joint mission?

00:05:22.884 --> 00:05:26.154
We have other support staff,
but this is essentially it.

00:05:26.154 --> 00:05:30.384
We've assembled BABEL's elite staff.
Is there some problem?

00:05:30.624 --> 00:05:33.394
Oh, no! This is your elite staff?!

00:05:33.994 --> 00:05:35.394
What're you implying?!

00:05:35.394 --> 00:05:38.524
I was sure you were just the
bottom-of-the-barrel espers!

00:05:39.374 --> 00:05:41.134
Especially you, over there!

00:05:41.134 --> 00:05:44.864
From what I saw at the resort,
I doubt you're a Level 7!

00:05:45.244 --> 00:05:46.614
What?!

00:05:46.614 --> 00:05:47.474
Kaoru!

00:05:47.474 --> 00:05:50.044
This is going to be a very dangerous mission!

00:05:50.044 --> 00:05:52.604
You kids are just going to get in the way!

00:05:52.854 --> 00:05:56.824
Fine, we'll just get Colonel... Gooly-gooly...

00:05:56.824 --> 00:05:57.474
Grisham.

00:05:59.284 --> 00:06:01.254
Um, Colonel Cream Stew...

00:06:01.254 --> 00:06:02.454
Grisham.

00:06:04.164 --> 00:06:06.794
We'll catch Colonel Grizzly ourselves!

00:06:06.794 --> 00:06:08.594
If you can.

00:06:08.594 --> 00:06:12.264
Darn it, don't act so cool just
'cuz your boobs are kinda big!

00:06:12.264 --> 00:06:15.434
You're one to talk, Little Miss Flat Chest!

00:06:16.374 --> 00:06:19.514
Don't go there! If my limiter
hadn't been on that time!

00:06:19.514 --> 00:06:20.974
Kaoru, stop it!

00:06:20.974 --> 00:06:22.814
Kaoru's right!

00:06:22.814 --> 00:06:24.444
She can't say that about us!

00:06:24.444 --> 00:06:28.154
Stop arguing! We don't have time for that!

00:06:28.154 --> 00:06:31.744
She's right. This is going to be
a dangerous mission! However!

00:06:33.424 --> 00:06:35.494
If you need the strongest espers,

00:06:35.494 --> 00:06:37.684
then I'll go with these girls
without any hesitation!

00:06:44.064 --> 00:06:47.004
You'll regret judging espers by appearances!

00:06:51.044 --> 00:06:54.164
You're the one with the thing
for little girls, aren't you?

00:06:55.074 --> 00:06:56.884
Dammit! Don't accuse me of that!

00:06:56.884 --> 00:06:57.674
Calm down.

00:07:04.654 --> 00:07:06.594
Wild Cat, moving out!

00:07:06.594 --> 00:07:07.884
Double Face, moving out!
Double Face, moving out!

00:07:08.754 --> 00:07:10.354
Naomi, wait!

00:07:11.064 --> 00:07:12.264
Where is the colonel?

00:07:12.264 --> 00:07:14.824
I'm sure I sense a defector somewhere.

00:07:15.234 --> 00:07:17.404
Okay, everyone, we're on!

00:07:17.404 --> 00:07:18.804
Yes, Master!

00:07:21.504 --> 00:07:23.574
He must have left some clues!

00:07:23.574 --> 00:07:25.374
I'll find them with these hands of mine!

00:07:29.584 --> 00:07:33.204
Minamoto! Why do we get stuck
sitting in HQ on standby?!

00:07:33.884 --> 00:07:36.754
Weren't you listening to the Chief?

00:07:36.754 --> 00:07:39.224
Right now, the Plague Sigma prediction unit

00:07:39.224 --> 00:07:42.154
is searching for where
Colonel Grisham will appear.

00:07:42.694 --> 00:07:46.634
We'll wait for the prediction
and then go straight there.

00:07:46.634 --> 00:07:48.464
That's why we're waiting here!

00:07:48.834 --> 00:07:51.834
You're BABEL's ace in the hole.

00:07:51.834 --> 00:07:53.404
When will we get the prediction?

00:07:53.404 --> 00:07:55.604
We don't know.

00:07:55.604 --> 00:08:00.444
Until it comes, we have to wait
here quietly with the others.

00:08:00.974 --> 00:08:03.944
I'm not wild about babysitting you kids, either!

00:08:03.944 --> 00:08:04.844
What?!

00:08:04.844 --> 00:08:07.404
I'm only here because I'm under orders!

00:08:09.384 --> 00:08:13.514
Ken, can you fill us in on
Colonel Grisham's exact powers?

00:08:13.824 --> 00:08:15.754
The truth is, I'm not sure.

00:08:18.094 --> 00:08:20.324
He's your superior, isn't he?

00:08:20.964 --> 00:08:24.364
Maybe, but he only took
command two weeks ago.

00:08:24.364 --> 00:08:28.324
And he hardly spoke to us about his powers.

00:08:28.904 --> 00:08:33.214
I've heard that he's an extremely
high-level telepath,

00:08:33.214 --> 00:08:35.574
but I don't know any details.

00:08:35.574 --> 00:08:38.044
I made an inquiry to the States,

00:08:38.044 --> 00:08:43.144
but esper intel is top secret in every
country, so I can't get an answer.

00:08:45.324 --> 00:08:46.824
I see.

00:08:46.824 --> 00:08:50.254
I thought the colonel was
suspicious from the start!

00:08:51.194 --> 00:08:53.064
What do you mean?

00:08:53.064 --> 00:08:57.764
Because he wanted so badly
to be stationed in Japan.

00:08:58.934 --> 00:09:01.504
The colonel's a real Japanophile.

00:09:01.504 --> 00:09:04.044
So, he could have just taken a vacation here!

00:09:04.044 --> 00:09:05.974
Men his age would normally retire!

00:09:05.974 --> 00:09:08.844
They don't go out of their way
to come here to work!

00:09:08.844 --> 00:09:10.384
She has a point.

00:09:10.384 --> 00:09:14.614
He must have been planning
to defect for a while now!

00:09:14.614 --> 00:09:16.954
He wanted to increase his value as an asset,

00:09:16.954 --> 00:09:20.914
so he must have come to
Japan to steal its secrets, too!

00:09:25.524 --> 00:09:27.064
Message from the Precog room.

00:09:27.064 --> 00:09:28.824
They seem to have gotten a prediction
on Colonel Grisham.

00:09:29.764 --> 00:09:31.134
Put it on the monitor!

00:09:32.734 --> 00:09:34.874
Prediction probability: 82%.

00:09:34.874 --> 00:09:39.004
Image is from two hours out.
Error range: +/- 15 minutes.

00:09:43.744 --> 00:09:46.914
It's Colonel Grisham! No doubt about it!

00:09:46.914 --> 00:09:49.254
He looks like he's waiting for someone.

00:09:49.254 --> 00:09:52.024
Probably an agent from the
country he's defecting to.

00:09:52.024 --> 00:09:53.154
Where is he?!

00:09:53.154 --> 00:09:54.684
Looks like a river embankment.

00:09:54.754 --> 00:09:56.324
It's pretty big, isn't it?

00:09:56.324 --> 00:09:59.554
Something that big would have
a sign posted somewhere.

00:10:00.364 --> 00:10:02.294
Zoom in on the right!

00:10:03.464 --> 00:10:04.764
ARAMAGAWA

00:10:04.764 --> 00:10:04.934
ARAMAGAWA
Aramagawa?!

00:10:04.934 --> 00:10:06.164
Aramagawa?!

00:10:07.104 --> 00:10:08.574
All right.

00:10:08.574 --> 00:10:11.134
Special espers, The Children!

00:10:15.214 --> 00:10:16.404
Released!

00:10:16.714 --> 00:10:17.234
<<RELEASED>>

00:10:20.984 --> 00:10:23.174
See through to the single truth!

00:10:23.884 --> 00:10:26.324
On the outside, we're children,
but inside, we're ladies!

00:10:28.024 --> 00:10:29.994
Undisputed Master Espers!

00:10:31.924 --> 00:10:33.984
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:10:35.294 --> 00:10:36.324
Ken!

00:10:37.704 --> 00:10:40.794
The bells of freedom that ring!

00:10:40.904 --> 00:10:43.894
The power of justice that smashes evil!

00:10:44.174 --> 00:10:46.644
The ones who won't be outdone
by a bunch of kids!

00:10:46.644 --> 00:10:48.574
The Liberty Bells!

00:10:48.574 --> 00:10:50.544
BABEL-1, take off!

00:10:55.314 --> 00:10:56.974
I'll explain the mission to you.

00:10:57.524 --> 00:11:00.094
Mission? Isn't it to just find Colonel Gooly-chan...

00:11:00.094 --> 00:11:01.694
Grisham.

00:11:01.694 --> 00:11:05.324
Um, find Colonel What's-his-name
and capture him, right?

00:11:05.524 --> 00:11:08.164
No, in the case of a defection like this,

00:11:08.164 --> 00:11:10.724
we need to find out the background players, too.

00:11:11.364 --> 00:11:12.904
What do you mean?

00:11:12.904 --> 00:11:15.374
In short, the colonel is probably
going to make contact

00:11:15.374 --> 00:11:17.564
with a foreign agent at
the Aramagawa embankment.

00:11:18.874 --> 00:11:21.944
If possible, we'd like to capture that agent, too.

00:11:21.944 --> 00:11:23.844
Piece of cake!

00:11:23.844 --> 00:11:28.384
I could capture him by myself
without any help from BABEL.

00:11:28.384 --> 00:11:32.324
Well, we could do it without
any help from Comerica!

00:11:33.124 --> 00:11:35.454
Fine, now back off!

00:12:01.214 --> 00:12:03.044
Evening.

00:12:04.954 --> 00:12:06.284
Nearly time.

00:12:14.194 --> 00:12:16.724
Break it up and privatize! Even BABEL!

00:12:19.934 --> 00:12:21.804
Gimme another drink.

00:12:23.774 --> 00:12:26.304
A Comerican esper team?

00:12:26.304 --> 00:12:28.344
What about them?

00:12:28.344 --> 00:12:31.384
They appear to be engaged in a
joint operation with BABEL.

00:12:31.384 --> 00:12:33.014
Oh, is that it?

00:12:33.014 --> 00:12:34.454
What should I do?

00:12:34.454 --> 00:12:36.354
You can just observe them for now.

00:12:36.354 --> 00:12:39.254
Contact me if they do anything of interest.

00:12:39.254 --> 00:12:40.354
Acknowledged.

00:12:40.354 --> 00:12:42.094
Kyosuke, gimme more!

00:12:42.094 --> 00:12:43.494
Get it yourself.

00:12:44.224 --> 00:12:45.954
Shut up and gimme!

00:12:47.094 --> 00:12:50.004
Just who are you talking back
to, you little rodent?

00:12:50.004 --> 00:12:51.304
Why, you! This is animal cruelty! Leggo!

00:12:51.304 --> 00:12:54.164
Hm. Maybe I should go see for myself?
Why, you! This is animal cruelty! Leggo!

00:13:11.884 --> 00:13:13.444
No sign of him.

00:13:13.954 --> 00:13:16.194
The Precog section at headquarters reports

00:13:16.194 --> 00:13:19.464
that the probability of him showing
up here has climbed to 96%.

00:13:19.464 --> 00:13:20.994
It's a near certainty.

00:13:20.994 --> 00:13:25.294
Comerican esper teams are guarding the
train station and the main road.

00:13:27.734 --> 00:13:29.834
No word from them, yet.

00:13:31.544 --> 00:13:32.744
What's wrong?

00:13:32.744 --> 00:13:33.704
There!

00:13:38.044 --> 00:13:39.444
Colonel Grisham!

00:13:39.644 --> 00:13:41.614
Impossible! When did he?!

00:13:41.614 --> 00:13:43.424
It's him, all right, but how?

00:13:43.424 --> 00:13:47.594
Sorry! Our observation line
may have a hole in it!

00:13:47.594 --> 00:13:50.654
Let's try and think of how we can capture him.

00:13:59.934 --> 00:14:03.544
What's taking so long?!
Isn't the other agent coming?

00:14:03.544 --> 00:14:06.304
He might have realized we were
here and aborted the contact.

00:14:06.304 --> 00:14:10.474
Or maybe he was never waiting
for anyone in the first place.

00:14:11.544 --> 00:14:15.084
Then he's just been waiting here
all this time for nothing?

00:14:15.084 --> 00:14:17.614
We need to know for sure.

00:14:25.494 --> 00:14:27.094
I don't care how you do it,

00:14:27.094 --> 00:14:30.534
just make contact with the colonel
and read his thoughts.

00:14:30.534 --> 00:14:33.034
If he isn't here waiting for someone,

00:14:33.034 --> 00:14:34.904
we'll move in to apprehend him at once!

00:14:39.874 --> 00:14:41.074
Now!

00:14:43.984 --> 00:14:45.814
I can't read anything!

00:14:45.814 --> 00:14:48.814
This man's thoughts are completely blocked!

00:14:48.814 --> 00:14:51.114
You're a Japanese esper, I take it?

00:14:52.124 --> 00:14:56.084
Shiho Sannomiya, a Level 7 psychometrist.

00:14:57.124 --> 00:14:59.524
He read my thoughts, instead!

00:15:00.164 --> 00:15:03.494
Surely you're sick of waiting there,
my dear friends from BABEL.

00:15:08.704 --> 00:15:09.634
No!

00:15:09.634 --> 00:15:11.304
H-How long has he known?!

00:15:11.304 --> 00:15:14.214
Even so, can you take on
this many espers at once?

00:15:14.214 --> 00:15:15.674
Please, surrender peacefully!

00:15:17.384 --> 00:15:20.074
Unfortunately, I can't let myself be captured yet.

00:15:20.614 --> 00:15:22.084
It's started!

00:15:23.484 --> 00:15:26.184
Then how about we play some ball?

00:15:26.184 --> 00:15:27.724
Beat him to a pulp!

00:15:27.724 --> 00:15:29.854
Yes, Master!

00:15:29.854 --> 00:15:31.754
A puppet master, huh?

00:15:32.494 --> 00:15:33.554
Charge!

00:15:34.634 --> 00:15:37.564
What are you swinging at me for?!

00:15:38.404 --> 00:15:41.164
PSYCHIC STUN SUBJECTION!

00:15:42.304 --> 00:15:45.844
Psychokinesis, huh? That's an interesting
application of your power.

00:15:45.844 --> 00:15:48.004
Impossible! I thought he was a telepath!

00:15:48.644 --> 00:15:49.614
Back at you.

00:15:49.614 --> 00:15:50.804
What?!

00:16:00.254 --> 00:16:03.694
You okay, Shiho? How dare you do that to them!

00:16:03.764 --> 00:16:05.124
I brought your clothes.

00:16:05.124 --> 00:16:06.454
HOLD IT!

00:16:07.034 --> 00:16:09.654
You're not getting him before I do!

00:16:10.764 --> 00:16:13.094
WATER DRAGON!

00:16:15.004 --> 00:16:16.844
Lieutenant Ford!

00:16:16.844 --> 00:16:20.504
I know every aspect of your powers.
You can't win.

00:16:28.014 --> 00:16:30.224
Is that fluid control?!

00:16:30.224 --> 00:16:33.674
Someone besides that lady
has mastered that skill?!

00:16:35.694 --> 00:16:38.124
I'll catch you, then!

00:16:39.024 --> 00:16:41.864
PSYCHIC WATER CUTTER ATTACK!

00:16:52.004 --> 00:16:53.664
Where'd he go?!

00:16:57.644 --> 00:16:58.614
There!

00:16:58.614 --> 00:17:01.204
I'm sure you've heard this story.

00:17:02.414 --> 00:17:06.894
A sufficiently high-level
telepath can have the power

00:17:06.894 --> 00:17:12.264
to make an opponent's power his
own just by reading their mind.

00:17:12.264 --> 00:17:14.824
What are you babbling about?!

00:17:16.934 --> 00:17:19.164
And your power is magnificent.

00:17:32.684 --> 00:17:37.214
I can use the power of any esper close by to me.

00:17:38.154 --> 00:17:40.654
It's the reason they call me the Esper Killer.

00:17:40.654 --> 00:17:41.994
Huh? What? I can't hear!

00:17:41.994 --> 00:17:44.354
Of course! This is my special technique!

00:17:45.694 --> 00:17:46.894
An ESP Lock!

00:17:46.894 --> 00:17:50.434
Without teamwork, even a high-level esper team

00:17:50.434 --> 00:17:53.454
is easy prey for me.

00:17:53.904 --> 00:17:56.674
If you Japanese and Comerican
espers had worked together,

00:17:56.674 --> 00:18:00.204
you might have been able to capture me.

00:18:00.744 --> 00:18:04.384
Colonel! How can you abandon your duty
and loyalty to your country?!

00:18:04.384 --> 00:18:05.974
It's nothing personal, Mary.

00:18:06.184 --> 00:18:07.804
Don't patronize us!

00:18:10.354 --> 00:18:14.014
Quit yapping and surrender quietly,
you self-centered old geezer!

00:18:14.954 --> 00:18:19.364
It's useless, little girl. I can use your power, too.

00:18:19.794 --> 00:18:21.734
Who cares?!

00:18:21.734 --> 00:18:25.794
An esper can get stronger just
from their fighting spirit!

00:18:32.674 --> 00:18:35.834
Now I'm thirsty. Gimme some juice.

00:18:36.844 --> 00:18:39.574
Have I met that old man somewhere before?

00:18:41.254 --> 00:18:42.784
You know him?

00:18:42.784 --> 00:18:44.544
Yes, that one time...

00:18:54.364 --> 00:18:58.854
Level 7 psychokinesis is truly impressive.
But do you know this story?

00:19:01.274 --> 00:19:03.004
He's speaking to us by direct telepathy!

00:19:03.434 --> 00:19:07.474
Long ago, Japan and Comerica were at war.

00:19:07.474 --> 00:19:08.744
Huh? Really?

00:19:08.744 --> 00:19:11.304
Eventually, the tide turned against Japan...

00:19:13.884 --> 00:19:16.904
It was battered by air raids
from Comerican bombers.

00:19:18.684 --> 00:19:21.224
The Japanese military came to a decision.

00:19:21.224 --> 00:19:24.954
There was a danger that zoo animals
might break out during a raid.

00:19:29.864 --> 00:19:31.364
Oh no, not this story!

00:19:31.364 --> 00:19:35.824
And so, it came time for three
elephants to be destroyed!

00:19:37.774 --> 00:19:38.794
Elephants?

00:19:39.274 --> 00:19:42.944
Those clever elephants refused
to eat their poisoned food.

00:19:42.944 --> 00:19:47.144
The only choice was to withhold their
food and starve them to death.

00:19:47.714 --> 00:19:52.674
Those elephants did their tricks with
all their might, begging to be fed!

00:19:53.954 --> 00:19:56.824
This is so sad, I'm losing my strength!

00:19:56.824 --> 00:19:58.084
Don't listen, Kaoru!

00:20:02.464 --> 00:20:03.864
KAORU!

00:20:03.864 --> 00:20:07.494
Until, finally, those three elephants...

00:20:08.804 --> 00:20:12.134
Their strength exhausted, they went to heaven!

00:20:27.454 --> 00:20:28.754
Failure!

00:20:28.754 --> 00:20:32.694
Not only was his power extraordinary,
but he's a master of esper combat!

00:20:32.694 --> 00:20:34.294
And really good at telling stories!

00:20:34.294 --> 00:20:36.094
He made me cry from just hearing it!

00:20:36.094 --> 00:20:36.934
Me, too.

00:20:36.934 --> 00:20:38.964
War is bad!

00:20:38.964 --> 00:20:42.134
I just got a report from the States.

00:20:42.134 --> 00:20:45.174
Colonel Grisham is a Level 7 telepath.

00:20:45.174 --> 00:20:49.044
He can also use the power of
any esper nearby to him!

00:20:49.044 --> 00:20:49.944
What?!

00:20:50.044 --> 00:20:55.214
That power lets him be feared
as the Esper Killer.

00:20:55.214 --> 00:20:59.684
Dammit, if we'd known that sooner,
we might have tried something else!

00:20:59.684 --> 00:21:01.554
What, is that a protest?!

00:21:01.554 --> 00:21:04.684
But this was force majeure! It wasn't our fault!

00:21:05.724 --> 00:21:07.794
Just as I thought.

00:21:07.794 --> 00:21:10.234
So, his esper powers have
developed to that level, huh?

00:21:10.864 --> 00:21:12.124
Interesting, huh?

00:21:13.164 --> 00:21:16.104
No doubt about it! It's the colonel's cell phone!

00:21:17.504 --> 00:21:19.504
Mary, can you bring it up here?

00:21:19.504 --> 00:21:20.774
All right!

00:21:24.244 --> 00:21:26.944
This isn't an esper team-issued phone!

00:21:26.944 --> 00:21:29.044
It's the colonel's personal one!

00:21:31.584 --> 00:21:33.354
His thoughts are still imprinted on it!

00:21:34.654 --> 00:21:39.184
Time and place... changed...
Tomorrow morning...

00:21:39.824 --> 00:21:41.354
This is!

00:21:42.094 --> 00:21:46.364
A lake... No, not a lake. A dam!

00:21:46.364 --> 00:21:49.704
The image is very specific,
like he's gone there several times!

00:21:50.104 --> 00:21:51.304
A dam?

00:21:51.304 --> 00:21:52.964
Is the dam in here?

00:21:57.044 --> 00:21:59.274
Here! No doubt about it!

00:21:59.744 --> 00:22:02.744
All right, we've got him! We need to act at once!

00:22:04.184 --> 00:22:06.714
Something's wrong here. We're being set up.

00:22:07.254 --> 00:22:08.294
Thank goodness! We'll catch
the colonel for sure, now!

00:22:08.294 --> 00:22:11.194
It's like he left that clue for us on purpose.
Thank goodness! We'll catch
the colonel for sure, now!

00:22:20.774 --> 00:22:26.204
Because, you're my heart's desire!

00:22:26.204 --> 00:22:26.504
Yeah

00:22:43.554 --> 00:22:46.824
When it comes to you, you see

00:22:48.564 --> 00:22:54.094
My ESP is no good at all

00:22:54.434 --> 00:23:00.564
Love is a puzzle that even

00:23:00.944 --> 00:23:03.204
Pythagoras couldn't solve

00:23:05.444 --> 00:23:10.144
Don't hang your head or have a tearful face

00:23:10.584 --> 00:23:15.454
Because miracles are born from smiles

00:23:16.124 --> 00:23:17.564
My, my, my heart's desire

00:23:17.564 --> 00:23:17.864
Zoom zoom!

00:23:17.864 --> 00:23:18.864
I want to make

00:23:18.864 --> 00:23:19.294
Bye-bye!

00:23:19.294 --> 00:23:23.024
You my bold desire

00:23:23.164 --> 00:23:27.174
So absolutely serious, it gives me chills!

00:23:27.174 --> 00:23:28.604
Trans, trans, transform

00:23:28.604 --> 00:23:28.904
Zoom zoom!

00:23:28.904 --> 00:23:29.874
I'll give you

00:23:29.874 --> 00:23:30.504
Yeah yeah!

00:23:30.504 --> 00:23:35.344
A dynamite kiss!

00:23:35.474 --> 00:23:38.244
I absolutely want you to love me!

00:23:38.244 --> 00:23:48.444
Because, you're my heart's desire

00:23:49.994 --> 00:23:51.064
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:51.064 --> 00:23:52.994
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:52.994 --> 00:23:53.324
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:53.324 --> 00:23:56.494
Having a lot of espers close by
will give him an advantage.

00:23:56.494 --> 00:23:59.234
We'll capture him using one type of esper!

00:23:59.234 --> 00:24:01.134
Psychokinesis, wouldn't you say?

00:24:01.134 --> 00:24:03.634
Exactly. The ones to directly confront
him should be Mary and Kaoru.

00:24:03.634 --> 00:24:05.144
It's just me and this little girl?!

00:24:05.144 --> 00:24:07.374
No way! I don't wanna work with her!

00:24:07.374 --> 00:24:09.014
Zettai Karen Children!

00:24:09.014 --> 00:24:12.114
Episode 16: "A Promise Is Worth Its
Weight In Gold! Memories of a Distant Day..."

00:24:12.114 --> 00:24:14.284
Do you know this story?

00:24:14.284 --> 00:24:15.014
Enough. Just talk normally.

00:24:15.014 --> 00:24:16.284
A Promise Is Worth Its Weight in Gold!
Memories of A Distant Day...
Enough. Just talk normally.

00:24:16.284 --> 00:24:18.584
A Promise Is Worth Its Weight in Gold!
Memories of A Distant Day...
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:18.584 --> 00:24:19.984
A Promise Is Worth Its Weight in Gold!
Memories of A Distant Day...
